NAME
	intelligence - target intelligence gathering and correlation module.

DESCRIPTION
	Analyze targets and correlate empirical scan data to assess attack
	surface, host characteristics, and potential vulnerability vectors.
	The intelligence module gathers DNS records, checks well-known network
	service heuristics, and generates actionable analysis distinguishing
	empirical facts from protocol hypotheses.

UNDERLYING TOOL
	Cyber Framework Intelligence Engine (native Python)

EXECUTION
	Native internal execution via core/intelligence_engine.py

USAGE
	use intelligence

MODULE OPTION
	target - target domain or IP address.

COMMANDS
	show modules
		Display available modules.

	set target <target>
		Define the target domain or IP.

	run
		Execute the intelligence analysis module.

EXAMPLE
	use intelligence
	set target example.com
	run

OUTPUT
	Target profile summary detailing empirical DNS records, open port
	analysis, detected services, and prioritized verification steps.

REQUIREMENTS
	Pure Python (no external binaries required).

AUTHOR
	Bhuvaneshkumar

VERSION
	Version 1.0
